{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benJeromeHenge-12178": "BEN: 好，到了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benJeromeHenge-12179": "BEN: 有时候我挺担心，你那位心上人是不是觉得我……死了也无所谓。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benJeromeHenge-12180": "BEN: 总觉得这整件事里，我就是堵“人墙”。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benJeromeHenge-12181": "JEROME: 放心，不只你有这种感觉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benJeromeHenge-12182": "JEROME: 不过以我对她的了解，她最终总会回到法律与正义这一边。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benJeromeHenge-12183": "JEROME: 有时手段……让人心惊罢了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benJeromeHenge-12184": "BEN: 真想让她除了那一小角面包，再吃点别的……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benJeromeHenge-12185": "JEROME: 我试了好多年，没指望。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benJeromeHenge-12186": "BEN: 哦，来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benJunaHenge-12187": "BEN: 好，到了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benJunaHenge-12188": "BEN: 反正还得等……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benJunaHenge-12189": "BEN: 我做的菜，有没有哪道让你觉得闻起来不错？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benJunaHenge-12190": "BEN: 你爱吃叶子，那葡萄叶包饭，总能试试吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benJunaHenge-12191": "JUNA: 嗯，我不太喜欢薄荷和柠檬。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benJunaHenge-12192": "BEN: 可以不放薄——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benJunaHenge-12193": "BEN: 等等，离那么远都闻得这么准？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benJunaHenge-12194": "BEN: 你隔多远能闻到松露？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benJunaHenge-12195": "BEN: 哦，来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benAgataHenge-12196": "BEN: 好，到了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benAgataHenge-12197": "BEN: 有件事，直到现在才想到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benAgataHenge-12198": "BEN: 守护者怎么退休？就靠“被杀”吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benAgataHenge-12199": "AGATA: 到了一定时候，就会升到更偏……决策的职位，或者去当教官。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benAgataHenge-12200": "AGATA: 也有成员不是在营房长大，而是成年后自愿加入。那些人过些年，通常会回部族。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benAgataHenge-12201": "BEN: 你呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benAgataHenge-12202": "AGATA: 还早得很。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benAgataHenge-12203": "AGATA: 可现在，我还有了兄弟和姐姐……真不知道。我还没想过。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benAgataHenge-12204": "BEN: 可别学教我做菜的那位老婆婆，该歇手的时候还不肯歇。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benAgataHenge-12205": "BEN: 她一头栽进一大锅汤里，当场就没了。偏偏赶上午饭最忙的时候，那锅汤还得端给客人！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benAgataHenge-12206": "BEN: 老太太有时候脾气是冲了点，可我还是想她。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benAgataHenge-12207": "BEN: 哦，来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benZikaronHenge-12208": "BEN: 好，到了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benZikaronHenge-12209": "BEN: 嘿，你存着那么多记忆……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benZikaronHenge-12210": "BEN: 有没有来自好厨师的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benZikaronHenge-12211": "ZIKARON: ……尝……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benZikaronHenge-12212": "BEN: 哦，好，哇。还真能尝到，嘴里都有味了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benZikaronHenge-12213": "BEN: 有没有……更好的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benZikaronHenge-12214": "BEN: 这个……不行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benZikaronHenge-12215": "BEN: 难吃。客观上就是难吃。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benZikaronHenge-12216": "BEN: 干！怎么这么干！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benZikaronHenge-12217": "BEN: 天，糟蹋这么好的橄榄油，简直犯罪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benZikaronHenge-12218": "BEN: 好，这鸡汤……还过得去。就停在这里吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benZikaronHenge-12219": "BEN: 哦，来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaJeromeHenge-12220": "CORDELIA: 不管在我的梦里看到了什么，都别过度解读。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaJeromeHenge-12221": "CORDELIA: 谁知道多少是此地那个幻灵捏造的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaJeromeHenge-12222": "JEROME: 老实说，相当温和。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaJeromeHenge-12223": "JEROME: 不过我们一起闯进去，你还没醒，倒让我有点意外。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaJeromeHenge-12224": "CORDELIA: 梦里见到你，本来也很寻常。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaJeromeHenge-12225": "CORDELIA: 我说的是“你们”，复数。别想歪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaJeromeHenge-12226": "JEROME: 做梦都不敢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaJeromeHenge-12227": "CORDELIA: 我要开始引发连锁反应了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaAgataHenge-12228": "CORDELIA: 稍等，我准备一下连锁反应。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaAgataHenge-12229": "AGATA: 那个元素灵，或者不管是什么生物，有可能逃出去吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaAgataHenge-12230": "CORDELIA: 也许。阻止它逃离的，未必是石阵本身。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaAgataHenge-12231": "CORDELIA: 反正尼古拉的世界里，再多一个四处作乱的家伙，又能怎样？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaAgataHenge-12232": "AGATA: 不管它会造成多小的影响，我都不想让它因为我们而逃出去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaAgataHenge-12233": "CORDELIA: 准备好了，可以开始连锁反应。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaJunaHenge-12234": "CORDELIA: 稍等，我准备一下连锁反应。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaJunaHenge-12235": "CORDELIA: 很快就会达到峰值。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaJunaHenge-12236": "CORDELIA: 等待的时候，有件事想问问。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaJunaHenge-12237": "JUNA: 问吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaJunaHenge-12238": "CORDELIA: 我不是博物学家，不过很好奇，你家乡究竟有多少物种拥有魔法、会说话？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaJunaHenge-12239": "JUNA: 它们都会说话。不过，你多半指杰兰德语吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaJunaHenge-12240": "CORDELIA: 正是。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaJunaHenge-12241": "JUNA: 呃，不多，大多是鸣禽。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaJunaHenge-12242": "JUNA: 听得懂，说不太好。就算有魔法，也很难控制那么多空气。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaJunaHenge-12243": "JUNA: 听说过一头叫杰姬的象，收养了一个人类儿子。不过也许就她一头。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaJunaHenge-12244": "CORDELIA: 真有意思。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaJunaHenge-12245": "CORDELIA: 啊，连锁反应开始生效了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaZikaronHenge-12246": "CORDELIA: 这样应该能引发连锁反应……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaZikaronHenge-12247": "CORDELIA: 虽然不指望得到回答，不过……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaZikaronHenge-12248": "CORDELIA: 希纳尔覆灭时，你真的就在它的外围？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaZikaronHenge-12249": "CORDELIA: 你必定见过许多……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaZikaronHenge-12250": "CORDELIA: 世上的学者为了听你口述，不惜倾尽一切。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaZikaronHenge-12251": "CORDELIA: 若有一天，你愿意说出千古秘密，务必告诉我。我保证会给予它们应有的重视。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaZikaronHenge-12252": "CORDELIA: 来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexAgataHenge-12253": "ALEXANDRA: 应该随时会来……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexAgataHenge-12254": "ALEXANDRA: 那个，我有个问题。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexAgataHenge-12255": "AGATA: 什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexAgataHenge-12256": "ALEXANDRA: 你我世界之间那道门，在那里多久了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexAgataHenge-12257": "AGATA: 那个位置？不知道，暴雨会移动。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexAgataHenge-12258": "AGATA: 我们靠商人和蛮族报告它现在的位置。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexAgataHenge-12259": "ALEXANDRA: 不，我是问……它存在多久了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexAgataHenge-12260": "AGATA: 哦……很久了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexAgataHenge-12261": "AGATA: 走陆路的商人往来你们城里，至少已有八十年了。那道门可能在更早以前就存在了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexAgataHenge-12262": "ALEXANDRA: 哇！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexJunaHenge-12263": "ALEXANDRA: 应该随时会来……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexJunaHenge-12264": "ALEXANDRA: 说真的……我一点也不会怀念这些事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexJunaHenge-12265": "ALEXANDRA: 一群人到底能惹上多少麻烦？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexJunaHenge-12266": "JUNA: 什么意思？你刚脱困，就立刻开始摆弄这个地方。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexJunaHenge-12267": "ALEXANDRA: 是，可到头来能拿到什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexJunaHenge-12268": "JUNA: 继续活着？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexJunaHenge-12269": "ALEXANDRA: 可我只要再也不进阴森的地牢，不也能活着吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexJunaHenge-12270": "ALEXANDRA: 最后从没什么好东西。比如巧克力……或者新款的一百二十伏电源。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexJunaHenge-12271": "JUNA: 或是一头漂亮的花斑公兽，春风送来它的气息……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexJunaHenge-12272": "ALEXANDRA: 呃……对，那个也行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexJunaHenge-12273": "ALEXANDRA: 哇！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexJeromeHenge-12274": "ALEXANDRA: 应该随时会来……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexJeromeHenge-12275": "ALEXANDRA: 我，呃……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexJeromeHenge-12276": "JEROME: 什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexJeromeHenge-12277": "ALEXANDRA: 就是，我……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexJeromeHenge-12278": "ALEXANDRA: 我也很喜欢科黛莉娅，不过，嗯……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexJeromeHenge-12279": "ALEXANDRA: 她让你一直这么等，未免……不太公平吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexJeromeHenge-12280": "JEROME: 抱歉，我不太明白。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexJeromeHenge-12281": "ALEXANDRA: 算了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexJeromeHenge-12282": "ALEXANDRA: （换了别人，早就求之不得了……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexJeromeHenge-12283": "ALEXANDRA: 哇！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexZikaronHenge-12284": "ALEXANDRA: 应该随时会来……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexZikaronHenge-12285": "ALEXANDRA: 那个……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexZikaronHenge-12286": "ALEXANDRA: 周围发生的一切，你都记得？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexZikaronHenge-12287": "ALEXANDRA: 能听多远、看多远？比如，别人说什么、做什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexZikaronHenge-12288": "ALEXANDRA: 我们的事，你到底会告诉多少人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexZikaronHenge-12289": "ALEXANDRA: 是只告诉特别的人，还得等我们都，呃，死了以后？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexZikaronHenge-12290": "ALEXANDRA: 到了那种神殿，你会不会把见过的每个人的事全抖出来？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexZikaronHenge-12291": "ALEXANDRA: 哇！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiJeromeHenge-12292": "NIKOLAI: 没看到动静。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiJeromeHenge-12293": "NIKOLAI: 真盼着哪天，这些活儿都归别人干。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiJeromeHenge-12294": "JEROME: 说实话，等这些事都结束了，我也不知道自己该做些什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiJeromeHenge-12295": "JEROME: 或许会有些意兴阑珊。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiJeromeHenge-12296": "NIKOLAI: 我也许买座农场，镇外安静点的地方。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiJeromeHenge-12297": "NIKOLAI: 我往田里一钻，谁也找不到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiJeromeHenge-12298": "NIKOLAI: 累都累够了，哪还会无聊。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiJeromeHenge-12299": "JEROME: 有些人确实适合这种生活。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiJeromeHenge-12300": "NIKOLAI: 是啊，我就是那种人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiJeromeHenge-12301": "NIKOLAI: 开始了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiAgataHenge-12302": "NIKOLAI: 有点担心，她根本不在乎会有什么后果。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiAgataHenge-12303": "AGATA: 你说科黛莉娅？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiAgataHenge-12304": "NIKOLAI: 对。里面那个灵体逃出去，又伤不到她。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiAgataHenge-12305": "AGATA: 而你在乎。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiAgataHenge-12306": "NIKOLAI: 是。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiAgataHenge-12307": "AGATA: 我也是。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiAgataHenge-12308": "AGATA: 显然是某种元素灵。放着不管会壮大，壮大了就会惹麻烦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiAgataHenge-12309": "NIKOLAI: 感觉它已经是某人的宠物了，也许更糟。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiAgataHenge-12310": "AGATA: 确实更糟。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiAgataHenge-12311": "NIKOLAI: 开始了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiJunaHenge-12312": "NIKOLAI: 没看到动静。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiJunaHenge-12313": "JUNA: 会来的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiJunaHenge-12314": "NIKOLAI: 以前我待过的一支部队，有驮运牲畜。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiJunaHenge-12315": "JUNA: 说话当心点。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiJunaHenge-12316": "NIKOLAI: 不不，我懂，你不一样。只是……你肯定也吃得跟它们一样多，说不定更多。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiJunaHenge-12317": "NIKOLAI: 在洞里或飞空艇上，怎么解决？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiJunaHenge-12318": "JUNA: 降落时吃草，亚历有时也帮我装些草料。她有个魔法袋子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiJunaHenge-12319": "NIKOLAI: 能装多少？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiJunaHenge-12320": "JUNA: 不知道，能装下的东西越来越多了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiJunaHenge-12321": "NIKOLAI: 得请她帮我装弹药……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiJunaHenge-12322": "NIKOLAI: 开始了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiZikaronHenge-12323": "NIKOLAI: 没看到动静。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiZikaronHenge-12324": "NIKOLAI: 嘿，能不能……叫个能对付这事的人出来？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiZikaronHenge-12325": "NIKOLAI: 你这里总不全是哲学家和命运多舛的名门少女吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiZikaronHenge-12326": "NIKOLAI: 你这里总不全是哲学家和屠杀的受害者吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiZikaronHenge-12327": "NIKOLAI: 肯定也有战士。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiZikaronHenge-12328": "NIKOLAI: 把他们叫出来，然后……砰，让他们指出弱点就行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiZikaronHenge-12329": "NIKOLAI: 没反应？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiZikaronHenge-12330": "NIKOLAI: 开始了。"
}
